   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Prepare Data for Modelling\n",
    "We selected `calories`, `carbohydrate`, `sugar`, `protein`, `category`, and `servings` as features, with `high_traffic` as the target variable. The following preparation steps were applied:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `recipe` was dropped as it is a row identifier with no predictive value\n",
    "- `high_traffic` was encoded as binary (High = 1, Low = 0)\n",
    "- `category` was one-hot encoded\n",
    "- Data was split into training (80%) and test (20%) sets, using stratification to preserve the class distribution across both sets\n",
    "\n",
    "**Modeling notes:**\n",
    "- Features were scaled using StandardScaler for Logistic Regression, as nutritional columns have very different ranges which can affect the model"
   ]
  },
