    "- **Logistic Regression:** accuracy 75.7%, precision 79.3%, recall 81.0%\n",
    "- **Decision Tree:** accuracy 75.6%, precision 78.2%, recall 82.8%\n",
    "\n",
    "They present low variance, indicating the models generalize well and the test set results are not a lucky split. \n",
    "\n",
    "Notably, cross-validation recall exceeds 80% for both models, meaning they also capture a strong proportion of truly popular recipes. Precision is just below 80% in cross-validation, which is expected given the variability across folds - the test set results (84.8–84.9%) are the more reliable estimate for this dataset.\n",
